       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ARITHMETIC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-A PIC 9(3) VALUE 10.
       01 WS-B PIC 9(3) VALUE 3.
       01 WS-SUM PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-DIFF PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-PROD PIC 9(5).
       01 WS-QUOT PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-REM PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-CALC PIC 9(7).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           ADD WS-A WS-B GIVING WS-SUM.
           SUBTRACT WS-B FROM WS-A GIVING WS-DIFF.
           MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-PROD.
           DIVIDE WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-QUOT REMAINDER WS-REM.

           COMPUTE WS-CALC = (WS-A + WS-B) * WS-A / WS-B.
           DISPLAY WS-SUM WS-DIFF WS-PROD WS-QUOT WS-REM WS-CALC.
           STOP RUN.
